WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.706
Quizzes check what learners know.

00:00:02.656 --> 00:00:10.078
Set a pass mark and how many attempts they have, then add multiple choice, ordering or matching questions.

00:00:11.064 --> 00:00:14.802
An assignment asks learners to make something real.

00:00:14.752 --> 00:00:19.987
Write the brief and the steps, and give a rubric so their work is marked fairly.

00:00:20.968 --> 00:00:26.490
Tick Free preview on a lesson to let anyone try it from the course page before they enrol.

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:30.086
It is a good way to show what your course feels like.

00:00:31.063 --> 00:00:35.062
Give learners a worksheet or slides with a Download block.

00:00:35.012 --> 00:00:40.442
Upload the file, give it a title, and it appears with a download button.
